<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Six people were killed by Cyclone Arnab on India’s eastern coast and a woman was killed with three injured when a tempo rolled down in Reasi, while a man was injured in a bear attack in South Kashmir. Security forces in Manipur arrested two NRFM cadres, seized weapons and 7.7 kg of brown sugar, and the DG of Assam Rifles reviewed border fencing and joint grids in Moreh. Former Maoist commanders married in Hazaribagh open jail as police intervened, and threats against migrant employees were reported in Kashmir. Kuki-Zo protesters demanded the release of three detained men, and the UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Press Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPQkNLY0Y2TnV5ei1GbExnMF9iUHZMQUpkcEMzUVNuREtTTVV3cklDd0IwZk1LSGxaNjQ2Ylp5ZzQ4MlR6d0I3OUIwaTMzRlJrY0VHaTNmTVlmMno1Z2JLYm1KZ0dBUUFsTEJRQ3BnUlpKd056VTBnSVJQV1NrYUliTmJHUVdHTXV5ek1hd0EteDJoTjM0cVJhODhvYzM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Roshan Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPUDNoTzVOc2ZZYmIzQWdhSTl1Sm1OamVwNVZKQ0JHMGVtWFE3RHprMGc2YmNnNzZOenY0THU4OHF4Q2lVZFhFTGJ0Z3hCU1pNSUxvelNLcGRkdWp0dndBN0tFR25LR0xEVE10TnFkOFZReFZ5eDNyZDVFXzRJMjRnVURUdFp4MFFJR2lienNySWllSUtIMnBsQ0lrY0RBUFBrZjRYU1dOYUk4UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNS2c0ZjlqbU5zaVphc2dfMW5zSTg5ZlZnSUJ0czZGcTNXcThQdlJmRnRFZmRDYkhEc1Zuc0F1WHNWbWlRQ2RBSjJ3Nm4yc3p1cnZOdlpMb3VzNkNJc29sdGRieHB3QmlsQmNmR1hVSnhDdnNnNm90aTg5cVFZZkZfeDE3cWswcGxscThFWDNEWUFicm5Pemc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNZ1IwVVU3OUFDOEJJUlF1MzAxSWNLOXBzOWxPRGVMUS1vaWswZlh3NFprLTc1bC1UUFRjckdpWUhrRzdl